# Infiltrate Davoi repeated (completed and current again), in Davoi. Zantaviat 102, whose finish sets status 6; then his
# own 101. The fourth '!' (211, 2, -104, out of every box) says its own message. The '!' in the east box gives the East
# Block Code (the key item reply) and sets status 7; again, held: its own message. The south '!' gives the South Block
# Code (status 8), the north '!' the North Block Code (status 9). Zantaviat 105, whose finish takes the three codes and
# sets status 10; at 10 the east '!' says its own message.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1012 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2012 NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1012 ChateauDoraguille/_6h0/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/553 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/554 Davoi/Quemaricond/onTrigger Davoi/Zantaviat/onTrigger Davoi/onZoneIn/1 Davoi/onEventFinish/102 Davoi/onEventFinish/105 Davoi/onEventFinish/116 Davoi/onEventFinish/117
char zone=Davoi pos=211,0,-9 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren completed
mission Sandoria TheRescueDrill completed
mission Sandoria TheDavoiReport completed
mission Sandoria JourneyAbroad completed
mission Sandoria InfiltrateDavoi completed
mission Sandoria InfiltrateDavoi current
login
trigger Zantaviat                       # 102
finish                                  # status 6
trigger Zantaviat                       # status 6: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
trigger !+3                             # the fourth '!' (211, 2, -104): nothing
finish-if-event
trigger !                               # the east block: the East Block Code, status 7
finish-if-event
trigger !                               # held: nothing
finish-if-event
trigger !+1                             # the south block: the South Block Code, status 8
finish-if-event
trigger !+2                             # the north block: the North Block Code, status 9
finish-if-event
trigger Zantaviat                       # 105
finish                                  # status 10, the three codes taken
trigger !                               # status 10: nothing
finish-if-event
